{"id":8657981,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/6008","number":6008,"state":"merged","title":"fix(fia): 修复GQA模式下mm1RopeKa计算与BNSD layout的actualSeqLengthsQ处理","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/6008","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/6008/issues","body":"## 描述\n修复 FIA 算子在 GQA 模式下 mm1RopeKa 计算逻辑错误，以及 BNSD layout 下 actualSeqLengthsQ 处理不当的问题。\n\n## 改动\n- flash_attention_no_quant_kernel_base.h: GQA 模式下 mm1RopeKa 应为 n2Size*gSize*dSizeRope，非 GQA 模式下应为 dSizeRope\n- fused_infer_attention_score_tiling_impl.cpp: BNSD layout 下 gsMergeFlag 时 actualSeqLengthsQ 应使用 S1Size 而非 actSeqLenQData\n\n## 关联的Issue\n#2724\n\n## 测试\n- 已在 ascend950 (arch35) 平台验证 GQA 和非 GQA 模式下 RoPE 计算正确性\n- 已验证 BNSD layout 下 actualSeqLengthsQ 计算符合预期\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug 修复","assignees_number":20,"assignees":[{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68b95648f58fe35f2d169ed4","login":"gaoxiang618","name":"gaoxiang618","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gaoxiang618","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c115ac4dcd85262391d21a","login":"wenxin_fight","name":"wenxin_fight","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","login":"mabing1118","name":"mabing","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/mabing1118","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65c6a68fa1fec6cc32e","login":"crystalhu","name":"胡碧霞","html_url":"htt